    var pL = [{
        id: "t1",
        title: "Standard Payment Terms",
        content: `PAYMENT TERMS

Payment is due within 30 days of the invoice date. Accepted payment methods include bank transfer, UPI, credit/debit card, and cheque.

Invoice Date: [Date will be auto-filled]
Due Date: [30 days from invoice date]

For bank transfers, please use the account details provided on this invoice.

Late payments may be subject to interest charges as per our late payment policy.

For any payment-related queries, please contact us at [Your Contact].`,
        category: "Payment",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t2",
        title: "Late Payment Policy",
        content: `LATE PAYMENT POLICY

Interest on Overdue Payments:
Any payment not received by the due date will incur an interest charge of 2% per month (24% per annum) on the outstanding amount.

Grace Period:
A grace period of 3 business days is provided after the due date before interest charges apply.

Calculation:
Interest is calculated on a daily basis from the due date until the date of payment.

Maximum Cap:
Total interest charges will not exceed 25% of the original invoice amount.

Payment Priority:
Partial payments will be applied first to interest charges, then to the principal amount.`,
        category: "Policy",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t3",
        title: "Net 15 Terms",
        content: `PAYMENT TERMS (NET 15)

Payment is due within 15 days of the invoice date.

Quick Payment Benefit:
To maintain our fast turnaround times and prioritize your projects, we require payment within 15 days.

Due Date: [15 days from invoice date]

Accepted payment methods: Bank transfer, UPI, cards, and online payment.

For urgent payment queries, contact us immediately.`,
        category: "Payment",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t4",
        title: "Net 60 Terms",
        content: `PAYMENT TERMS (NET 60)

Payment is due within 60 days of the invoice date.

Extended Payment Window:
We offer extended payment terms of 60 days to support your cash flow management.

Due Date: [60 days from invoice date]

Payment can be made via bank transfer, cheque, or online payment.

Please ensure payment is processed before the due date to avoid any service interruptions.`,
        category: "Payment",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t5",
        title: "Advance Payment Required",
        content: `ADVANCE PAYMENT TERMS

50% Advance Payment:
An advance payment of 50% of the total invoice amount is required before commencement of work.

Balance Payment:
The remaining 50% is due within 15 days of project completion or upon delivery, whichever is earlier.

Payment Schedule:
- Advance: 50% (\u20B9[Amount]) - Due immediately
- Balance: 50% (\u20B9[Amount]) - Due on completion

Refund Policy:
Advance payments are non-refundable once work has commenced.

Work will begin only after receiving the advance payment confirmation.`,
        category: "Payment",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t6",
        title: "Milestone Payment Terms",
        content: `MILESTONE-BASED PAYMENT

Payment Structure:
Payments are released upon successful completion and approval of each project milestone.

Milestone Payment Schedule:
- Milestone 1: [Description] - \u20B9[Amount] - Due: [Date]
- Milestone 2: [Description] - \u20B9[Amount] - Due: [Date]
- Milestone 3: [Description] - \u20B9[Amount] - Due: [Date]

Approval Process:
Each milestone requires your written approval before payment is due. Payment must be made within 7 days of milestone approval.

Delayed Payments:
Work on subsequent milestones may be paused if payment for completed milestones is pending.`,
        category: "Payment",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t7",
        title: "Project Delivery Terms",
        content: `DELIVERY & PAYMENT TERMS

Payment Before Delivery:
Final deliverables will be released only upon receipt of full payment.

Delivery Timeline:
Final delivery will be made within 2 business days of payment confirmation.

What You'll Receive:
- All source files
- Final deliverables in agreed formats
- Documentation (if applicable)
- Transfer of ownership rights

Inspection Period:
You have 7 days from delivery to report any issues or discrepancies. After this period, deliverables are considered accepted.`,
        category: "Delivery",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t8",
        title: "No Refund Policy",
        content: `REFUND POLICY

All Sales Are Final:
All payments made for services rendered are final and non-refundable.

Service Modifications:
If you wish to modify the scope of work, additional charges may apply. Original payment remains non-refundable.

Cancellation:
If you cancel the project after work has commenced, no refund will be provided for work completed up to that point.

Exceptional Circumstances:
Refunds may be considered only in cases where we are unable to deliver the agreed services due to reasons within our control.`,
        category: "Policy",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t9",
        title: "Service Warranty",
        content: `SERVICE WARRANTY

30-Day Warranty:
We provide a 30-day warranty on all services from the date of final delivery.

What's Covered:
- Bugs or errors in deliverables
- Functionality issues as per agreed specifications
- Technical defects

What's Not Covered:
- Changes to original scope
- Issues arising from client modifications
- Third-party service failures
- Browser or platform updates (unless specified)

Claiming Warranty:
Report issues within the warranty period via email. We will address valid claims within 5 business days.`,
        category: "Warranty",
        isCustom: !1
    }, {
        id: "t10",
        title: "Cancellation Policy",
        content: `CANCELLATION POLICY

Cancellation Notice:
A minimum of 48 hours' notice is required for cancellation of scheduled services or meetings.

Cancellation Charges:
- More than 48 hours' notice: No charge
- 24-48 hours' notice: 50% of invoice amount
- Less than 24 hours' notice: 100% of invoice amount

Work in Progress:
For ongoing projects, payment is due for all work completed up to the cancellation date.

Refund Processing:
If any refund is applicable, it will be processed within 7-10 business days.

Rescheduling:
We offer one free reschedule if notified at least 24 hours in advance.`,
        category: "Policy",
        isCustom: !1
    }];

